note df32_@T@: acc (f64 bits) + sum of f64(w*x) over @T@ lanes; fin 1 returns the f32 bits of the total.
fn df32_@T@ acc ulong w view f32 @T@ x view f32 @T@ fin ulong to ulong
s = bitcast f64 acc
for i ulong @T@
s = add s f64 mul get w i get x i
end
if eq fin 1
ret ulong bitcast uint f32 s
end
ret bitcast ulong s
end
